          <math id="algorithm1.m43" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{M}^{t,l}\leftarrow\mathbb{I}(\bm{S}^{t,l}&gt;\theta^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑴</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝕀</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑺</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">&gt;</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{M}^{t,l}\leftarrow\mathbb{I}(\bm{S}^{t,l}&gt;\theta^{t})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.24.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="algorithm1.m44" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{X}^{l}\leftarrow\bm{X}^{l}\odot\bm{M}^{t,l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑿</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑿</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑴</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{X}^{l}\leftarrow\bm{X}^{l}\odot\bm{M}^{t,l}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.24.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.25" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.25.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.25.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.25.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.25.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">22</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.6.25.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">if</span><span id="algorithm1.6.25.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><em id="algorithm1.6.25.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;"><math id="algorithm1.m45" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{B}_{m}\in\{B^{p}_{v},B^{p}_{l},B^{p}_{c}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">{</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>p</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>p</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.110em" minsize="1.110em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{B}_{m}\in\{B^{p}_{v},B^{p}_{l},B^{p}_{c}\}</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="algorithm1.6.25.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.25.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.26" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.26.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.26.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.26.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.26.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.26.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">23</span></span>
          <span id="algorithm1.6.26.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#808080;"># Follow the pruning framework in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib42" title="" class="ltx_ref">42</a>]</cite>: accumulate importance every <math id="algorithm1.m46" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{J}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathcolor="#808080">𝒥</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{J}</annotation></semantics></math> steps and uniformly decay the mask to <math id="algorithm1.m47" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> for stability.</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.27" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.27.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.27.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.27.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.27.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.27.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">24</span></span>
          <math id="algorithm1.m48" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{S}^{\prime p}\leftarrow\bm{S}^{\prime p}+\text{CIP}(\bm{S}^{t},\bm{W},\bm{X})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑺</mi><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">′</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑺</mi><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">′</mo><mphantom></mphantom><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">CIP</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑺</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑾</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝑿</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{S}^{\prime p}\leftarrow\bm{S}^{\prime p}+\text{CIP}(\bm{S}^{t},\bm{W},\bm{X})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.27.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  
</span><span id="algorithm1.6.27.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#808080;"># Calculate token-weighted parameter importance by CIM</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.28" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.28.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.28.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.28.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.28.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
