<td id="S5.T6.6.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r"><span id="S5.T6.6.4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">79.71</span></td>
<td id="S5.T6.6.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T6.6.4.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">26.19</span></td></tr>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table G</span>: </span><span id="S5.T7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation results of <math id="S5.T7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> in  <a href="#S3.E9" title="In Priority Refinement with Exploration and Historical Information ‣ 3.3 Multi-Mode Pruning Strategy ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ Collaborative Multi-Mode Pruning for Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> on BLIP using the NLVR2 dataset at a pruning ratio of 0.8. The default setting is <span id="S5.T7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</span></figcaption>
